       "text": "I haven't entered this order, because the dose looks like an error.\n\nIbuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum of 3,200 mg/day. The 1,600 mg single dose is also twice the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose. At this level the risks of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up substantially, even in a patient with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nYou may have meant one of these:\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day total)\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n\nTell me which regimen you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1,600 mg four times daily, confirm that and give me the clinical rationale. I'll add it to the order note."
